---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "March 19, 2026";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - rakunlabs" description="Terms of Service for rakunlabs.io — the rules and guidelines for using our website and services.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-[5%] py-8 pb-16">
    <h1 class="inline-block text-2xl font-bold px-3 py-1 bg-accent text-white border-y border-black">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-muted text-[13px] mt-3 mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-black">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-2 pb-1 border-b border-black">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary leading-7 mb-3">
      By accessing and using the rakunlabs.io website ("Website") and any services provided by
      rakunlabs ("Services"), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms").
      If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use our Website or Services.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-2 pb-1 border-b border-black">2. Description of Services</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary leading-7 mb-3">
      rakunlabs is an open source organization that provides software tools, libraries, and
      related services. Our Services include:
    </p>
    <ul class="text-secondary leading-7 mb-3 pl-6 list-disc">
      <li class="mb-1">Access to open source software projects hosted on GitHub</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Documentation and resources related to our projects</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Any web-based tools or applications we may provide</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-2 pb-1 border-b border-black">3. Open Source Software</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary leading-7 mb-3">
      Our open source projects are made available under their respective open source licenses
      (e.g., MIT, Apache 2.0, etc.). The specific license for each project is indicated in the
      project's repository. Your use of our open source software is governed by the applicable
      open source license, which may grant you additional rights beyond these Terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-2 pb-1 border-b border-black">4. User Accounts and Authentication</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary leading-7 mb-3">
      Some of our Services may require you to create an account or authenticate using third-party
      providers (such as Google). When using authentication services, you agree to:
    </p>
    <ul class="text-secondary leading-7 mb-3 pl-6 list-disc">
      <li class="mb-1">Provide accurate and complete information</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Maintain the security of your account credentials</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Promptly notify us of any unauthorized use of your account</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Accept responsibility for all activities that occur under your account</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-2 pb-1 border-b border-black">5. Acceptable Use</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary leading-7 mb-3">You agree not to use our Website or Services to:</p>
    <ul class="text-secondary leading-7 mb-3 pl-6 list-disc">
      <li class="mb-1">Violate any applicable laws, regulations, or third-party rights</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Upload, transmit, or distribute any malicious code, viruses, or harmful content</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Attempt to gain unauthorized access to our systems or other users' accounts</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Interfere with or disrupt the integrity or performance of our Website or Services</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Engage in any activity that could damage, disable, or impair our infrastructure</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Use automated systems (bots, scrapers, etc.) to access our Services in a manner that exceeds reasonable use</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Impersonate any person or entity, or misrepresent your affiliation with any person or entity</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-2 pb-1 border-b border-black">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
