      <li class="mb-1">Logos, trademarks, and branding</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Original documentation and written content</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-secondary leading-7 mb-3">
      The rakunlabs name and logo are trademarks of rakunlabs. You may not use our trademarks
      without prior written consent, except as permitted by applicable law.
    </p>

